        "original_id": "2c66b76a-8bbd-5d87-8b34-d36cb88bd56f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Characters: Principal Skinner, Patty Bouvier, Selma Bouvier, Hans Moleman, Homer Simpson\n- Episodes: “Principal Charming”\n- People: Harry Shearer, Matt Groening, Dan Castellaneta\n- Series: The Simpsons\n\nFacts:\n- In the episode “Principal Charming,” Homer Simpson invites Principal Skinner to dinner, but Principal Skinner falls for Patty Bouvier instead of her twin sister Selma Bouvier.\n- Principal W. Seymour Skinner, born Armin Tamzarian, is a fictional character in the American animated sitcom The Simpsons.\n- Harry Shearer voices Principal Skinner in The Simpsons.\n- Hans Moleman was created by The Simpsons series creator Matt Groening.\n- Hans Moleman is voiced by Dan Castellaneta.\n- Hans Moleman first appeared in the episode “Principal Charming.”",
